WEBVTT

00:08.390 --> 00:10.550
AozoraSubs and TMUsubs  present

00:11.000 --> 00:15.390
Daa! Daa! Daa!

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
Mukai awase ni suwatta shunkan ni

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
The moment we sat facing each other

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
otona no yokogao ni DOKI DOKI shiteru no

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
my heart was thumping at the sideways view of your adult-like face

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Itsudemo soba ni iru hazu demo

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Although you're always beside me

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
hontou wa KIMI no koto yoku shiranai yo ne

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
the truth is I don't really know much about you

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
Itsumo nakamatachi to asonderu kedo

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
We're always playing with our friends

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
futarikiri ni naru to doko ka chigau yo

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
but when we're alone, something's different

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Nanika hanashi kakete

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Talk to me about something

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
Zutto dare yori mo daisuki da yo

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
I've always loved you more than anyone else

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
dakedo ienai yo chikasugiru yo

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
but I can't say it, you're too close

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Itsuka kizuite yo mitsumeteru yo

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Someday, notice I'm gazing at you

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
Koi no TANE wo maitara

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
When we plant the seeds of love

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
hora sakasou yo ippai

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
see, they will all bloom fully

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
Mou kamisama ni onegai

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
That's my wish to God

01:22.400 --> 01:24.380
It's so cold...

01:28.240 --> 01:31.450
I guess this morning's colder than I thought...

01:31.450 --> 01:34.550
The old-timers say some good things...

01:34.550 --> 01:37.290
Yes, yes. Miyu-san's in charge of the windows.

01:37.290 --> 01:39.970
It's because you're the overall in-charge, Kanata-san.

01:39.970 --> 01:41.700
But it's cold!

01:41.700 --> 01:43.330
Please wait a bit more...

01:43.760 --> 01:45.530
What are you saying?

01:45.530 --> 01:48.950
Earlier when Ruu-chama, Pepo, and I woke up,

01:48.950 --> 01:51.250
it was <i>way</i> colder than this!

01:52.180 --> 01:53.380
Pepo!

01:53.870 --> 01:56.710
Okay, okay. Maybe I understand...

01:56.800 --> 01:58.920
But... it's so cold~!

02:11.500 --> 02:13.990
What's that? What in the world is that?

02:20.920 --> 02:22.910
What's that? What's happening?

02:22.910 --> 02:24.620
No matter how you look at it, it's not a thing from Earth.

02:26.620 --> 02:28.290
This is bad!

02:29.030 --> 02:30.250
What's all this?!

02:30.250 --> 02:32.630
How did this happen~?!

02:34.330 --> 02:36.600
They're not from Earth... that means...

02:36.600 --> 02:38.520
Ugh... again?!

02:39.230 --> 02:41.910
You mean, those folks?!

02:42.010 --> 02:46.970
Goodbye, Waru Waru Gang

02:55.370 --> 02:58.420
Okay! 35th experiment, start!

03:06.220 --> 03:09.190
Sis, let's stop this for now~!

03:09.190 --> 03:11.330
Right~ I'm so scared!

03:11.830 --> 03:14.650
What's that? What kind of weak thing are you saying to me?

03:14.650 --> 03:16.420
This time, everything will go all right~!

03:20.730 --> 03:23.200
There, it appeared! The space-time distortion.

03:23.200 --> 03:26.680
I'm telling you, that has also appeared before!

03:28.190 --> 03:31.850
Look! A totally needless thing has come out again!

03:31.850 --> 03:33.520
No~! No! No!

03:40.670 --> 03:45.530
<i>Why</i> did you start an experiment on the space-time distortion generation equipment again?

03:47.110 --> 03:51.200
I heard that, you know. Yeah~ I did.

03:51.850 --> 03:53.040
Come on, do it.

03:53.040 --> 03:54.040
Huh? Again?

03:57.310 --> 04:03.160
What made me start researching on the
space-time distortion generation equipment?

04:03.960 --> 04:10.030
Ah... After incurring a huge debt in Planet Sharaku, we, the Waru Waru Gang finally arrived on Earth.

04:10.800 --> 04:12.780
With no choice but to take the wrong way,

04:12.780 --> 04:19.830
we devised various schemes to catch the baby from Planet Otto, but failed miserably.

04:20.160 --> 04:21.530
However!

04:21.530 --> 04:27.470
Oh, look! Since last week, the space-time around the Saionji area seems to be unstable.

04:27.780 --> 04:31.010
That's right, we're genius scientists.

04:31.010 --> 04:37.020
We're doing something unfamiliar, so the best thing would be to invent a device to control the space-time distortion...

04:37.550 --> 04:38.300
...right?

04:38.300 --> 04:39.550
What?!

04:39.850 --> 04:43.120
Space-time distortion is a matter of concern for the entire universe.

04:43.120 --> 04:47.220
If we invent a machine that could control it, we'd be rich.

04:47.440 --> 04:52.490
Even though we borrowed money just recently, we're still in need of it!

04:54.680 --> 05:00.100
Just a minute, Sis! The real reason we're in debt is because that experiment failed.

05:00.100 --> 05:03.710
We had to slip out of Planet Sharaku.

05:03.710 --> 05:04.700
That's right!

05:04.880 --> 05:08.020
That time, too, it brought out a lot of strange creatures.

05:08.020 --> 05:11.470
Sis, have you forgotten about how you failed last time?

05:14.240 --> 05:15.460
She's forgotten...

05:15.880 --> 05:18.370
Okay! Let's do one more experiment!

05:20.220 --> 05:22.080
Stop this now!

05:22.080 --> 05:24.110
We're begging you~!

05:24.110 --> 05:27.770
Oh! I think it's time for us to sell the new umbrellas...

05:27.770 --> 05:28.590
That's right, that's right!

05:33.750 --> 05:34.580
Huh?

05:35.870 --> 05:37.750
Uh...

05:38.710 --> 05:40.600
Cut it out!

05:40.600 --> 05:41.170
What?

05:41.170 --> 05:42.840
I wonder what she's talking about?

05:43.490 --> 05:44.440
We're talking about that. That!

05:44.870 --> 05:46.780
Weird creatures making a lot of noise...

05:47.080 --> 05:50.370
You're looking for a chance to kidnap Ruu-chama again, aren't you?

05:50.560 --> 05:51.820
What? There's no such thing!

05:51.820 --> 05:52.740
Don't get us wrong!

05:52.740 --> 05:55.360
That tail looks like rat's breath...

05:55.360 --> 05:56.330
Don't play dumb!

05:56.330 --> 05:58.540
What are you getting so noisy about?

05:59.720 --> 06:02.630
We've turned over a new leaf.

06:03.040 --> 06:06.130
We don't do things like kidnapping babies anymore.

06:06.840 --> 06:09.130
I'm not at all convinced.

06:09.130 --> 06:14.330
It's true. As scientists, we're diligently conducting experiments-

06:18.950 --> 06:20.460
It's sad, isn't it?

06:20.860 --> 06:24.250
To be never trusted in this lifetime,

06:24.250 --> 06:30.110
just because of some small misdeeds that we did in the past...

06:30.110 --> 06:30.820
Sis!

06:30.820 --> 06:32.780
We three sisters...

06:32.780 --> 06:35.400
...will not bend before the cold winds of the society.

06:35.400 --> 06:38.180
We'll join forces and continue living.

06:40.400 --> 06:44.160
One, get rid of these guys double-quick.

06:44.160 --> 06:46.840
Two, let's not get worked up anymore.

06:47.370 --> 06:50.280
That's right. Do something right away.

06:50.280 --> 06:51.800
Er...

06:52.940 --> 06:56.700
By bringing these creatures along with you, you've brought bad luck on yourselves!

06:57.400 --> 07:00.270
That's terrible! That's too much!

07:00.520 --> 07:01.730
You understand now, right?

07:01.730 --> 07:02.580
Y-yeah...

07:02.580 --> 07:03.850
W-we do.

07:03.850 --> 07:06.030
Well, let's go home and eat breakfast.

07:10.040 --> 07:11.330
You're going home, I see...

07:11.980 --> 07:14.530
Well, let's start the experiment once again!

07:14.910 --> 07:17.690
What?! Even though you promised you're going to stop?

07:17.690 --> 07:18.850
You're so naive.

07:18.850 --> 07:22.880
To have their research go unappreciated is a badge of honor for scientists.

07:23.560 --> 07:26.670
Besides, I'm a woman who had been evil once.

07:27.060 --> 07:30.680
I can tell a lie or two with a straight face!

07:37.090 --> 07:38.560
We're stuck.

07:38.560 --> 07:40.970
For the time being, we've to go along with Sis' experiment.

07:41.700 --> 07:46.230
But, you know, I think we should stop with our evildoing.

07:46.230 --> 07:46.940
Because...

07:47.700 --> 07:55.760
To Understand
All About Earth!

07:48.180 --> 07:50.160
If you try and read this...

07:50.160 --> 07:55.240
it says <i>terrible</i> fate awaits those who do evil on earth!

07:55.240 --> 07:55.740
What?!

07:56.620 --> 07:59.400
Like monsters coming out of huge hampers...

07:59.400 --> 08:01.600
Or being drowned in whirlpools...

08:01.600 --> 08:03.000
You're scaring me!!!

08:03.280 --> 08:08.090
That's why, this time around we had a narrow escape, so we must stop our evil works!

08:08.090 --> 08:09.300
Yeah! Let's fight on!

08:11.800 --> 08:14.550
Come 'round, ladies and gentlemen!

08:14.550 --> 08:19.630
Today, we're going to show you our new product - the strong, safe and secure, multi-purpose umbrella!

08:19.630 --> 08:21.350
Everyone! Look! Look! Take a look!

08:21.620 --> 08:22.500
What's that?

08:22.500 --> 08:24.310
Doing something weird again?

08:24.370 --> 08:26.770
This umbrella isn't just an ordinary one.

08:27.080 --> 08:30.010
It's incredibly strong and is made of Sharaku metal.

08:30.010 --> 08:33.810
Whether it's falling spears or man-made satellites, you don't have to worry!

08:33.860 --> 08:34.740
What?

08:34.740 --> 08:36.040
Sharaku metal?

08:36.040 --> 08:37.380
Falling spears?

08:37.380 --> 08:38.580
Man-made satellite?

08:38.800 --> 08:42.250
And we're throwing in a freebie as well! Look, look!

08:43.420 --> 08:47.750
An exceptional item that comes handy when it rains suddenly and you have to get to class!

08:48.070 --> 08:50.520
Guava-chan, the overseas student?

08:51.070 --> 08:54.190
Guava-chan and Miyu-chan are friends...

08:54.730 --> 08:56.290
That umbrella...

08:56.290 --> 08:59.060
It must be a present for Miyu-chan.

08:59.430 --> 09:02.360
It's raining, Kanata. Come, share this umbrella with me.

09:02.360 --> 09:03.890
Thank you, Miyu.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.900
You're so kind.

09:05.900 --> 09:07.100
You're the same.

09:07.100 --> 09:08.940
Hey... come closer to me.

09:09.370 --> 09:11.140
And in this way...!

09:11.140 --> 09:15.850
When inverted, it can be used as a frame for drying the laundry!

09:19.360 --> 09:21.280
What? Why?!

09:21.790 --> 09:23.290
As expected, huh?

09:23.290 --> 09:27.080
And then the two of them would walk together, lovey dovey...

09:27.610 --> 09:30.060
...and run, run, run away!!!

09:33.720 --> 09:35.500
Oh, she has that much strength?

09:35.500 --> 09:36.500
It's Chris-chan, you know.

09:36.500 --> 09:37.110
Oh my.

09:37.810 --> 09:39.480
I'm sorry about that.

09:48.150 --> 09:51.270
Miyu-san, what shall we have for dinner?

09:51.720 --> 09:53.730
Hmm... anything's fine.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.960
Pepo!

10:05.670 --> 10:07.270
Don't touch that, Ruu-chama.

10:08.530 --> 10:11.640
You came from outside, didn't you? Get out!

10:14.720 --> 10:16.230
I said no!

10:17.210 --> 10:17.760
Ruu...

10:18.170 --> 10:23.210
That thing must indeed be cute, but we don't know what exactly Waru Waru Gang's planning.

10:24.470 --> 10:25.720
Ruu-kun...

10:28.920 --> 10:30.990
Yo! I came again.

10:30.990 --> 10:34.070
It's the poor space traveler, Yabushi Seiya~!

10:34.390 --> 10:35.950
Seiya-kun, huh...

10:35.950 --> 10:38.870
I see... So he really did come again...

10:41.680 --> 10:42.990
What? Waru Waru Gang?

10:43.210 --> 10:46.260
That's right. They're just too persistent~!

10:46.260 --> 10:47.170
Hmph! Hmph!

10:47.170 --> 10:51.680
But didn't the Waru Waru Gang run away after that incident when Ruu-kun had multiplied himself into hundred selves?

10:51.680 --> 10:53.190
So you didn't know?

10:53.190 --> 10:55.400
They returned immediately after that.

10:55.400 --> 10:58.220
That's right. They're just too persistent~!

10:58.220 --> 10:59.030
Hmph! Hmph!

10:59.030 --> 11:02.720
They <i>persistently</i> keep on targeting Ruu-chama.

11:03.020 --> 11:06.700
I see... So Waru Waru Gang's nearby...

11:07.430 --> 11:08.750
Lucky!

11:14.490 --> 11:17.030
I've reported the gang to the intergalactic police.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.660
Reported?

11:18.660 --> 11:24.290
In any case, they're the guys who have run off, leaving debts all over Sharaku.

11:24.290 --> 11:26.170
There's a reward involved.

11:26.170 --> 11:27.360
Reward?

11:27.360 --> 11:32.560
Er, no... it's not like I'm doing this for the reward or anything.

11:32.560 --> 11:40.720
It's just that I want to let everyone live with ease, that's all... er... that's...

11:41.210 --> 11:43.220
So you're after the reward, huh?

11:46.690 --> 11:50.700
But... What will happen to them when the intergalactic police takes them away?

11:50.700 --> 11:52.150
Will they be sentenced to... death?

11:52.150 --> 11:52.850
No way!

11:53.370 --> 11:59.980
Perhaps they'll be made to work their debts off for the Sharaku government or something...

11:59.980 --> 12:01.000
I see.

12:01.000 --> 12:04.920
Anyway, the intergalactic police force will be coming here soon.

12:04.920 --> 12:05.950
Coming...?

12:06.330 --> 12:08.360
Don't tell me... it's that guy?

12:24.070 --> 12:24.840
As we thought.

12:27.670 --> 12:28.920
Hey~!

12:28.920 --> 12:30.770
Please let us out!

12:30.770 --> 12:32.600
You were going at full speed...

12:37.020 --> 12:39.530
Why is it like this?

12:43.010 --> 12:46.030
Just the same as ever, these guys... Really...

12:51.410 --> 12:52.410
Pepo-po~!

12:52.710 --> 12:55.600
Ah~! Seriously, give me a break!

12:55.600 --> 13:00.060
If we dig this out, we'll have to fill it again...

12:59.830 --> 13:01.170
Got that right!

13:13.770 --> 13:14.730
Hi~!

13:16.420 --> 13:17.560
How have you been lately, youngsters?

13:17.790 --> 13:19.570
Uh... Well...

13:20.720 --> 13:23.450
Even so, you got here quite fast... coming here.

13:24.560 --> 13:26.850
We were just heading towards Saionji.

13:26.850 --> 13:27.990
Uh... heading this way?

13:27.990 --> 13:31.280
What I mean to say is that we have something to report...

13:40.540 --> 13:42.260
What are they doing?

13:42.260 --> 13:44.150
They got engaged.

13:45.410 --> 13:48.800
You! Why did you have to say such an embarrassing thing~!

13:49.130 --> 13:51.580
Ah, congratulations!

13:51.580 --> 13:52.560
That's wonderful.

14:01.990 --> 14:03.780
Paired super-romantic engagement rings!

14:04.880 --> 14:06.450
Paired wrist watches!

14:06.530 --> 14:07.790
Ooh~

14:07.790 --> 14:09.270
Paired socks!

14:09.270 --> 14:10.660
Paired ballpens!

14:10.660 --> 14:11.820
Paired mugs!

14:11.820 --> 14:12.980
Paired spoons!

14:12.980 --> 14:14.430
Paired como toilets!

14:14.430 --> 14:16.190
Paired table tennis rackets!

14:16.190 --> 14:17.360
Paired vases!

14:17.360 --> 14:19.070
Paired piggy banks!

14:20.820 --> 14:23.620
I wonder what I should do with Ruu today...

14:26.500 --> 14:28.130
I wonder what those are...

14:28.130 --> 14:33.570
Oh? I don't think they're guests... who have come to Ruu's house...

14:33.570 --> 14:35.750
I wonder if I should go home?

14:36.310 --> 14:36.640
Huh?

14:39.550 --> 14:41.060
Pepo, Pepo!

14:41.060 --> 14:41.860
Playing tag?

14:42.350 --> 14:44.660
I wonder what that fluffy thing is...

14:44.660 --> 14:46.370
Wait, Ruu!

14:47.560 --> 14:48.660
Pepo!

14:52.110 --> 14:53.240
Ah!

14:53.240 --> 14:55.790
Isn't that the evil ladies' house?

14:58.770 --> 15:00.370
Once again, we couldn't sell anything.

15:00.640 --> 15:04.620
It's like all we did was run away and not accomplish a thing, really...

15:04.620 --> 15:06.880
What are you doing, making such long faces?

15:07.360 --> 15:09.240
Let's go with a bang!

15:09.240 --> 15:11.220
Time for experiment no. 37!

15:11.460 --> 15:12.980
Stop it already!!!

15:12.980 --> 15:14.180
Sister!!!

15:17.890 --> 15:19.490
Hey, it's the baby from Otto!

15:22.510 --> 15:24.310
Hey, stop it!

15:24.310 --> 15:26.330
My head's spinning!

15:26.330 --> 15:28.870
What's the baby from Otto doing here?

15:28.870 --> 15:29.730
Who knows...

15:29.730 --> 15:31.070
Don't act like you don't know!

15:31.070 --> 15:33.160
You old ladies! Your evil motive has been found out!

15:33.490 --> 15:36.580
You're using that fluffy thing to draw Ruu out and kidnap him, aren't you?

15:36.580 --> 15:37.280
What?!

15:37.280 --> 15:38.200
You're mistaken!

15:38.200 --> 15:39.660
I'm not an old lady!

15:40.060 --> 15:41.710
Paired tripods!

15:41.710 --> 15:42.860
Paired ponzu juice!

15:42.860 --> 15:44.040
Paired soap dishes!

15:44.480 --> 15:45.640
Paired wet towels!

15:45.640 --> 15:46.810
Paired clips!

15:46.810 --> 15:48.100
Paired ear picks!

15:48.100 --> 15:49.640
Ruu-chama!

15:51.780 --> 15:53.260
Ruu-chama's not here.

15:53.260 --> 15:53.860
What?!

15:53.860 --> 15:55.180
Could he be with the Waru Waru gang?

15:56.300 --> 15:58.150
What did you say?!

15:59.860 --> 16:03.350
It's all a misunderstanding. We've given up our evil ways.

16:03.350 --> 16:04.400
That's right! That's right!

16:04.700 --> 16:08.110
Stop making excuses and hand over Ruu quickly!

16:08.110 --> 16:10.190
But that child came here on his own-

16:10.190 --> 16:13.610
Ah!!! Our wheat chocolates!

16:13.610 --> 16:19.200
Even though everyday I've been saving up for it and was looking forward to it...

16:21.130 --> 16:22.430
So cruel~

16:22.430 --> 16:24.280
This is just too much...

16:24.280 --> 16:25.540
It's all gone.

16:25.840 --> 16:28.050
I'm sorry that the old lady's-

16:28.610 --> 16:29.960
I'm <i>not</i> an old lady!

16:30.360 --> 16:32.270
Waru Waru Gang, watch out!

16:32.270 --> 16:38.000
Space Police Force Space Detective Moroboshi Teru has arrived-

16:41.020 --> 16:42.360
W-what's that?

16:42.360 --> 16:43.800
That full speed's quite...

16:43.800 --> 16:45.070
...scary~!

16:45.070 --> 16:46.060
Waru Waru Gang!

16:46.060 --> 16:46.440
Oh!

16:46.730 --> 16:48.140
Kanata-niitan!

16:48.140 --> 16:50.820
You guys... Are you trying to kidnap Momoka-kun too?

16:50.820 --> 16:51.420
You're wrong!

16:51.420 --> 16:52.360
Ruu-kun!

16:52.360 --> 16:53.040
Mama!

16:53.040 --> 16:53.960
Wannya!

16:53.960 --> 16:54.980
Momoka-san!

16:54.980 --> 16:56.180
Thank goodness!

16:56.180 --> 16:58.240
Thank goodness everyone's alright!

17:00.880 --> 17:02.920
You've gone too far, Waru Waru Gang!

17:02.920 --> 17:05.670
Kidnapping children, and defeating an officer in a single blow!

17:05.750 --> 17:07.120
We didn't do it, we didn't!

17:07.120 --> 17:08.130
Ah!!!

17:08.180 --> 17:10.060
Please, please listen to what we have to say!

17:08.180 --> 17:10.190
Teru! Teru!

17:10.650 --> 17:11.650
Teru!

17:13.080 --> 17:14.680
No need to worry...

17:16.360 --> 17:19.760
Waru Waru Gang, you've forced me to do this.

17:22.290 --> 17:26.230
What's that?! You can't use it without any provocation!!!

17:26.230 --> 17:28.070
Stop it! Stop it!

17:28.070 --> 17:30.400
Teru-san, that kind of weapon...

17:30.400 --> 17:32.940
She's right. Couldn't it be resolved in a more peaceful manner?

17:32.940 --> 17:35.090
It's okay. It's a tranquilizer gun.

17:35.090 --> 17:36.250
Tranquilizer gun?

17:36.250 --> 17:39.360
Whoever gets hit will be put to sleep. The longer they are asleep,

17:39.360 --> 17:42.160
their bodies will be 25 times number than sitting down on the floor for an hour.

17:42.160 --> 17:45.050
Ah... What a horrible gun~

17:57.430 --> 17:58.550
I have a bad feeling...

18:07.050 --> 18:08.930
W-what's that?!

18:11.070 --> 18:12.980
Oh no! It's the space-time distortion!

18:13.250 --> 18:15.780
Waru Waru Gang! What terrible thing have you done?!

18:15.780 --> 18:18.450
Ah, Moroboshi! Isn't this your fault?!

18:24.150 --> 18:25.250
What?!

18:48.490 --> 18:49.610
Pepo!

18:49.610 --> 18:50.520
No! Ruu-kun!

18:50.750 --> 18:52.170
Ruu~!

18:55.090 --> 18:57.030
Ruu! Momoko-chan! Pepo!

18:57.360 --> 18:58.340
Reach out your hand!

19:02.320 --> 19:04.520
Kanata-niitan!!!

19:08.310 --> 19:09.710
Grab hold of this!

19:12.020 --> 19:13.050
Guava!

19:21.470 --> 19:22.960
Ah!

19:28.670 --> 19:30.830
The suction force has stopped...

19:31.590 --> 19:33.760
This umbrella came in handy after all.

19:34.450 --> 19:36.550
Momoka-chan! Ruu!

19:36.550 --> 19:37.770
Papa!

19:37.770 --> 19:39.120
Ruu-chama!

19:41.010 --> 19:45.180
Thank goodness! Thank goodness...

19:47.820 --> 19:49.200
What a surprise...

19:53.920 --> 19:57.530
Could it be... because of the Sharaku metal's magnetic field?

19:58.500 --> 19:59.420
Er...

19:59.830 --> 20:02.610
Isn't that magnificent, Waru Waru Gang-kun?

20:03.230 --> 20:04.150
What?

20:04.150 --> 20:10.080
I didn't know... that you'd invented something that can control the space-time distortion~!

20:10.080 --> 20:12.350
Forgive me for not having understood till now.

20:12.680 --> 20:15.200
This machine looks like it's still in development stage,

20:15.200 --> 20:18.440
but once it's completed, it'll be of great help to everyone in the universe!

20:18.780 --> 20:19.930
That's right.

20:19.930 --> 20:22.820
Tragic accidents, like the one that happened to Ruu-chama, can be avoided.

20:22.820 --> 20:24.020
That's great!

20:24.020 --> 20:25.490
Will you do it, Waru Waru Gang?

20:26.120 --> 20:28.810
Huh?! Ah... well...

20:30.850 --> 20:34.560
That's right~! We're scientists, you see.

20:34.560 --> 20:36.670
We were just pretending to be evil~

20:36.950 --> 20:38.720
We were only pretending to be evil?

20:38.720 --> 20:40.480
I didn't know that~

20:40.480 --> 20:42.960
I don't think anyone knew that.

20:48.060 --> 20:49.320
Hello!

20:49.320 --> 20:49.970
Hello!

20:49.970 --> 20:51.480
Uh, hello~

20:51.780 --> 20:57.620
So with that, we've decided to return to Sharaku, and we dropped by here to say goodbye...

20:57.620 --> 21:04.320
It's been decided that we'll research the space-time distortion control machine in the intergalactic federation's research station.

21:04.750 --> 21:06.050
Is that so?

21:06.050 --> 21:07.650
That's good, that's good!

21:07.650 --> 21:10.120
With this, we'll have some peace around here...

21:10.120 --> 21:15.620
Ah! Those creatures that came out during the space-time distortion have been returned to their original worlds.

21:15.620 --> 21:16.790
Yes! Yes!

21:18.500 --> 21:21.830
Ah! That furball? That's also gone back.

21:22.730 --> 21:23.940
Pepo...

21:23.940 --> 21:25.250
Ah, look, look!

21:25.250 --> 21:27.390
Here, I'll give you this toy that I made.

21:31.050 --> 21:32.550
Pepo-po!

21:34.440 --> 21:35.440
Well then!

21:35.440 --> 21:40.200
We don't know whether to apologize for causing all the trouble so far, or thank you...

21:42.660 --> 21:44.490
Would you like to have something to eat or drink?

21:44.850 --> 21:47.050
If only somebody would offer me something, too...

22:02.850 --> 22:05.150
These inventions are our pride and joy!

22:05.150 --> 22:05.980
Use them, okay?

22:05.980 --> 22:07.050
What?!

22:07.350 --> 22:08.450
Hey~!

22:08.900 --> 22:10.690
It's about time we head back!

22:10.690 --> 22:12.050
Okay~!

22:23.430 --> 22:26.020
Bye, bye... Earth.

22:40.150 --> 22:42.030
Troublesome to the end...

22:42.030 --> 22:45.020
What... We don't need this much stuff!

22:45.020 --> 22:46.840
I don't need them, either.

22:46.840 --> 22:50.360
What should we do with all of this stuff?!

22:46.840 --> 22:48.900
<i>Wannya's childcare journal:</i>

22:48.900 --> 22:52.690
<i>The Waru Waru Gang caused trouble right up till the end.</i>

22:52.690 --> 22:55.380
<i>But I want them to do their best everyday,</i>

22:55.380 --> 22:59.530
<i>and quickly succeed in making the
space-time distortion control machine!</i>

23:00.750 --> 23:03.990
Alright! Let's do our best in our research, okay~!

23:03.990 --> 23:07.600
Hey, hey! Will they serve meals at the research station?

23:08.470 --> 23:10.820
Of course, they will! You're free to have second helpings as well!

23:11.060 --> 23:13.830
What?! Second helpings, too? Isn't that great?

23:13.830 --> 23:15.370
There's also side dishes there, you know!

23:15.370 --> 23:18.170
What?! Gorgeous!

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
Motto tanoshii koto ga

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
I felt that everyday

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
afureru mainichi

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
more fun-filled days

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
matteru kigashita

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
were waiting ahead

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
datte kimi to mata aeta kara

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
because I was able to meet you again

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Nee ima wa aserazu

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Hey, now, without being in a rush

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Yukkuri aruite

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Walk slowly

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Takusan waratte

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Laugh a lot

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
Soshite nanika wo mitsuketara

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
And when you find something

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
daiji ni shiyou

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
let's cherish it

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
mata aeta ne

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
until we meet again

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Issho ni iyou

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Let's stay together

24:22.140 --> 24:29.960
The End

24:29.960 --> 25:00.040
Next Episode

24:31.320 --> 24:34.390
Dang it! Valentine's Day has finally come!

24:34.390 --> 24:35.340
To Kanata, I guess I should-

24:35.340 --> 24:36.610
Miyu! What are you doing?

24:36.610 --> 24:37.810
No! You can't look!

24:37.810 --> 24:38.690
W-what's that about?

24:38.690 --> 24:39.890
Miyu-san~!

24:39.890 --> 24:42.290
What's Valentine's Day?

24:42.290 --> 24:43.870
Next on Daa! Daa! Daa!:

24:43.870 --> 24:45.390
Valentine's in Heio Town

24:45.390 --> 24:48.990
Everyone, even Aya-chan and Nanami-chan... they're all preparing chocolates with all their might~

24:48.990 --> 24:51.490
Oh~ Are you going to give me chocolates, too?

24:51.490 --> 24:52.820
Pepo!

24:52.820 --> 24:54.850
Everyone's getting festive.

24:54.850 --> 24:56.650
What should we do, I wonder?
